# Root deploy of the BRAIN: the static site is web/dist, the one function is api/ask.mjs.
# The function's import closure (api/ask.mjs -> act, bin, core, memory, reason, tasks, world, seeds,
# cells, genome, mind, simulate, viz, lab, learning, cli, daemon, io, lang, capability, generations,
# self, tools/budget.mjs, bench/answer.mjs) must stay; everything else stays home.
# Every pattern is anchored to the root with a leading slash: an unanchored 'organism' also dropped
# web/dist/organism (the exact reader the page imports), which is how the live bar timed out on 2026-09-26.
/.git
/.github
/.claude
/state
/work
# bench/fixtures stays home except the 200 MB knowledge pack the function reads on the host (order 42 clause d,
# bench/verdicts/knowledge-pack.json): gitignore syntax cannot re-include a file under an excluded directory,
# so each level is excluded with /* and the one child re-included.
/bench/fixtures/*
!/bench/fixtures/wiki
/bench/fixtures/wiki/*
!/bench/fixtures/wiki/pack-200
/bench/verdicts
/bench/*.jsonl
/organism
/site
/docs
/notes
/test
/research
/manual
/web/src
/*.md
# The knowledge pack is fetched at build time by tools/fetch-pack.mjs (the vercel.json buildCommand) from the public
# Blob store brain-pack, so it is never uploaded by the CLI and never in git; a git push deploys the site with it
# (preview dilation-65o9pgw1g, 2026-09-30: 13 fetched, 199984995 bytes, 4332ms in the build).
/bench/fixtures/wiki/pack-200
